Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only he didn't tell us\Nhow to use the things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back at the castle, just as the whole\Nplace was totally blowing up around us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy figured out how to open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got through right before Dokugumon\Nwould have made us into lunch meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're back home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only this time we've\Ngot a serious mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find the eighth child and save\Nhim from Koromon, or else!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Clash with Mammon in Hikarigaoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.98,0:02:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mammon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.14,0:02:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back in camp where we\Nstarted We've got to get to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highton View Terrace and stop\NMyotismon before he finds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the 8th Digidestined I wonder\Nhow much of a head start
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has on us Not even a minute\Nhas passed between the time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon left for Japan and\Nwhen we arrived Time flows
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at a different pace in the\NDigi-world I'll say we've been
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gone for months in the\NDigi-world and yet here in the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,real world it's the same day\Nwe left But that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean all those adventures took less\Ntime than it does to, say, get a haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Joe, don't exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine getting your hair done\Nin such a short amount of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go take a look at the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see for myself how\Nmuch time has really passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of you come with me,\Nthe rest of you stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who volunteers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.42,0:03:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One volunteer, not 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd keep you company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're going to keep Mimi company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we're all pretty curious to find\Nout what happened while we were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how will we explain it\Nif somebody sees our Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are back in the real world!\NMr. Fujiyama! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are all of you kids\Ndoing playing around
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here when you haven't even\Npacked up your gear yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, I can explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm Ty's Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you kids hear that we're closing\Nup camp early because of the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is all ready to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, of course we heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at those dirty little\Ntoys you're carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's he calling a dirty little toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't let anyone know you can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretend to be stuffed animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, these toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.94,0:03:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, they're stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Tai, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we found them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were hiking up an\Nuncharted trail when we came
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:04:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,across these stuffed toys\Nthat someone had thrown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes perfect sense if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind\Nwould hike up an uncharted
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trail just to throw away\Nseven stuffed animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly our point, and that's why\Nwe think that littering is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But being the good citizens that\Nwe are, we cleaned up the mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now I'm giving the toys to my\Nlittle sister, Kari, as a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wasn't able to come to camp, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She caught a cold, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but she's feeling much better now\Nbecause I went home and made her an omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I... When?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right before I left for camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.20,0:04:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice that you're thinking of\Nyour sister, Tai, but don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those toys are filthy and\Nbelong in the garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet you at the bus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get his gear together\Nand throw him in the garbage can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you won't be littering, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The human world is so cluttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All these creatures crammed\Non top of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ape that you dust in lives nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's next, Myotismon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, until the sun goes down,\NI must remain hidden in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Begin the search without me. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down, Lord Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, don't talk in\Nfront of anyone else, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can just pretend to be\Nadorable stuffed animals. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at all the kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we just say not to talk out loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but look at all the human children!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never knew there were\Nmore human children than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, just in the city alone, there must\Nbe tens of thousands of kids just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when you add the rest of the kids\Nin the world, there must be millions!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean there are millions of soras?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:05:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just means there\Nare more kids our age,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there are tons of\Ndifferent people in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Michelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.02,0:06:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've missed you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You missed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just saw me ten minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi's weird. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's wigging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too much caffeine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll give us away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told her no time has passed\Nsince we went to the DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find some form of\Ntransportation to Highton View Terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiyama, can you have the\Nbus drop us off somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the bus drop you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules say I have to take\Nyou straight to your homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiyama, I'm begging you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you just let us off somewhere\Nnear Highton View Terrace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highton View Terrace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we used to live there,\Nand we were feeling nostalgic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we thought we'd visit our old hangout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we appreciate it, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I think we drive pretty\Nclose to Highton View Terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:06:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we take the freeway to the\Nparkway to the throughway, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here at the roadway, Highton View\NTerrace is within walking distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that's where you\Ncan let us off, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't give the bus\Ndriver permission yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll break DK's heart\Nif you don't let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the last place\Nwe all lived together
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a family before my\Nparents got divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K. Oh, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiyama, please let us\Noff at Highton View Terrace
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an upperclassman, I'll take\Nresponsibility for getting them home Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess if a reliable kid like you is\Ngoing, Joe, then it's okay However,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.24,0:07:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,call your parents and tell\Nthem where you are Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.12,0:07:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiyama You're the greatest\Nteacher ever Yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.60,0:07:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how long are you\Ngoing to keep that act up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey if we didn't come up with\Nsomething sappy like that he never
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would have let us go you mean\Nthat sad story was just an act
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i was crying my eyes out so much\Nfor you guys that my glasses
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,started to fog up joe calm down\Nbefore you have an asthma attack
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i missed all of you so\Nmuch i hope she's not
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna act this way with\Nevery kid that she meets
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My laptop is in perfect working\Ncondition here in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the Digivice is working, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the latest toy\Nall you kids are into?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's just one of the\Nold ones that we all hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good with electronics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike other children, you\Nreally listen to your teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no harm in just letting\Nhim take a look at it, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For about a second there, I thought Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:08:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiyama was an evil Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you've spent way too\Nmuch time in the Digi-World.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.46,0:09:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he were an evil Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every time you failed a test, he'd\Nscream out his attack, Homework Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's more like Tickle Blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's this way, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't turn over a rock without\Nfinding a kid under it in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet I still haven't found\Nthe eighth digit destined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you couldn't\Nfind the 8th Digi Destined?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have failed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt me, your evil ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have made several copies of the\N8th Digi Destined's Tag and Crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one that you have is a copy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'm a copycat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The original's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though they're only copies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.62,0:10:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they will still become activated\Nwhen the eighth child is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, make no mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must find that child. Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when you do find\Nhim, then he must die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were nice to drop us off here\Nyeah there's the height and view
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terrace tower the tallest apartment\Nbuilding in japan terrific i'm afraid of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:11:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heights that place isn't so hot that's\Ntrue the heat never worked i used to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live there? Wow, Sora, you lived in that\Nbig castle? Yep, I live near here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a block away in another building.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora and I went to Westside\NElementary together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I went to Westside Elementary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that you guys\Nwere telling the truth when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you said you used to live\Nin Highton View Terrace?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we really did live here\Nbefore my parents broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a long time ago\Nwhen I was a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.78,0:11:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange coincidence because\NI used to live here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lived here too before we moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me too. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.70,0:11:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So at some point we all\Nlived at Highton View
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't just be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be some meaning here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otismon's army! Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can run, but they\Ncan't hide from Mammothmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A new motorcycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:12:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Respect other people's property,\Nyou big walking shack carpet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, whoever owns this elephant should\Nknow there's a leash law around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, honey, how cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wild elephant on the rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be filming a movie or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that big-eared freak trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destroy the Digidestined\Nwith everything else, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never should have brought that\Ntype of Digimon along for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's a car, it's got\Nan awful lot of trunk space
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna call the cops
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My phone's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say do any of you remember this place\Ni bought candy here it was my favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,store oh sure mine too you probably don't\Nremember this place tk because you were
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too little but mom and dad used to take\Nus here all the time maybe some candy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will help me to remember you're awfully\Nquiet is he didn't you like living in
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Highton View terrace i don't remember\Nhow long did you live there just for a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little while about six months wow why did\Nyour parents move away i don't know you're
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kidding well if you don't know then maybe\Ni should tell you why what do you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joe yeah joe how could you know why izzy's\Nparents moved away from here did you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know them or something no i didn't know\Nizzy back then but i did see what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what if my Myotismon has found the kid\Nalready i mean he's been searching the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,city all day that's true hey wait a second\Nat a time like this i think would be
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,far better off just to find a cave and\Nhide hey i am trying to make a decision
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here so don't interrupt me that's it\Ndoomed the heat has baked our brains and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're all gonna end up like roasted piglet\Ni'm a stay at home and read kind of guy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.38,0:14:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lighten up a little joe we're just trying\Nto look on the positive side of things
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something. Where are we? Is this\Nworld for real, or am I imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where there's trouble,\Nthere's my Otis Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monster Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's called Mammothmon.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.11,0:14:53.12,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Mammon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.11,0:14:53.12,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.11,0:14:53.12,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.11,0:14:53.12,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ancient Beast Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.11,0:14:53.12,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attacks
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.11,0:14:53.12,Sign,,370,0,332,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Tusk Strikes
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.11,0:14:53.12,Sign,,370,0,355,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Tundra Breath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a fully digivolved Digimon with\Nthe strength of a woolly mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shoots missiles he\Ncalls Tusk Crusher and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has a chilling attack\Ncalled Freezing Breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.20,0:14:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a danger zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:14:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.15,0:14:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can anyone there hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The radio's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he sees us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That monster's fully digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.36,0:15:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.26,0:15:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!\NDigimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Verge, Ramon! There were two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were two monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, TK was insisting\Nthat he saw two monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my mom was upset at him for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I really did see monsters, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, there's no such thing as monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were just imagining it\Nor maybe it was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Mommy, I saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear any\Nmore of these crazy stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just assumed he\Nimagined the entire thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when did all this take place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just assumed he\Nimagined the entire thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right on this footbridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dust Crusher!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we gotta get off this bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.02,0:17:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm having deja vu all\Nover again meteor wing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is just how it happened\Nback then a giant ball of fire
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroyed the bridge something\Nis definitely different i
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember the fire breathing\Nmonster didn't fly There had to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be another one you're right\Nthere were two monsters fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.62,0:17:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they were different than these two
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters, Garudamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dust Crusher!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garudamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fire-breathing monster I saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Greymon and another Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zora!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Greymon! Zora! Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day Koromon came to my house\Nand Digi-volved into Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was fighting with\Nthe bird-like Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Novabon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:18:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the fight, they disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shadow Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the fight that day, Greymon\Nand the other Digimon disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exactly somehow the Digimon were\Ninvolved all along that's why my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little sister already knew Koromon\NKari met him back on that day
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you met her it must have been a\Ndifferent Koromon but I did have
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a strange feeling when I first\Nmet Tai that we had met somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.74,0:19:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before listen it's the cops they'll\Nask a ton of questions they'll
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blame us for all this I'm too\Nyoung to go to the big house you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know I always thought it was kind\Nof strange that out of all the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:20:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kids at camp We were the only ones\Nchosen to go to the DigiWorld,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I knew it couldn't\Njust be coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, we were all connected\Nby some common event.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, I discovered what that event was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all took French in school? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four years ago, we were all living at\NHighton View Terrace at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all of us saw those two Digimon fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the eighth Digidestine\Nsaw the Digimon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, so the person who's the eighth\NDigidestine had to have been there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if Myotismon has\Nfound the kid already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's been\Nsearching the city all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.76,0:20:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if the child lived here four\Nyears ago, maybe it's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mammothmon wouldn't be\Nmaking all this commotion
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if they'd already found\Nthe 8th Digidestined child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon is still searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say the child is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe he moved like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find him before\NMyotismon, the 8th Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be someone we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.52,0:21:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outro music.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myself, I'm a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be one more time. I'll be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just how I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la la la,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are finally going to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.18,0:22:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are looking for a dream\Nthat we are looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the people of the\Ncountry who are in the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,city of the country are\Ngoing to take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people of the country who are in the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,city of the country are\Ngoing to take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the hamburgers are bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's why it wasn't a big surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.92,0:22:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time on Digimon Adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:22:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.61,0:23:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.02,0:23:04.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Great Digimon Crossing in Tokyo!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.27,0:23:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon! Thank you.

